title: Ignore valid BCP47 Language tags in the Naver Whale Extensions store
state: open
created: 2025-03-30T19:08:52Z
updated: 2025-03-30T19:08:52Z
labels: []
body:
Currently extensions with languages which have non-regional subtags can not be uploaded to the Naver Extensions Store. Examples are:
`zh_Hant`, `zh_Hans`, `zh_Hant_HK`, `sr_Latn`, `ca_valencia`

Browsers and other extension stores simply ignore these kind of languages tags. The Naver Whale Extension Store should simply ignore these language codes and accept extensions with them included.

See https://forum.whale.naver.com/topic/39749/ and https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/724
